    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists... it's just another thing to schedule, another obligation on a calendar that's already too full. i've tried the 'shifts'. i've tried the vacations, the mindfulness, the sabbaticals. nothing reaches the core of it. it’s like i’ve reached the end of the road and there’s nothing left there but more road. it feels less like a 'signal' and more like a conclusion. like i've just run out of capacity to exist in this way.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
